          "type": "step",
          "id": "gathering-ingredients:1yx475a",
          "html": "Go south-east, then west up the hill and pick the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Poppies_(Hearts_of_Sanguine)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">poppies</a> next to the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Cardinal_marker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">cardinal marker</a> at the top of the cliff to obtain a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Wendlewick_poppy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Wendlewick poppy</a>.",
          "text": "Go south-east, then west up the hill and pick the poppies next to the cardinal marker at the top of the cliff to obtain a Wendlewick poppy.",
