        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "gathering-ingredients:1o28j53",
          "html": "To the south-west of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Shrine_of_Inanna\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Shrine of Inanna</a>, near the jackalope burrows, kill a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Hedgehog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">hedgehog</a> and pick up the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Hedgehog_spines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">hedgehog spines</a>.",
          "text": "To the south-west of the Shrine of Inanna, near the jackalope burrows, kill a hedgehog and pick up the hedgehog spines.",
