    {
      "id": "anti-sanguine-scientifically",
      "title": "Anti-sanguine scientifically",
      "anchor": "Anti-sanguine_scientifically",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Complete the following steps, in order, to craft an <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Antisanguine_(Hearts_of_Sanguine)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">antisanguine</a> potion; if you end up with a black <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ruined_potion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ruined potion</a> after any step, you must start over from the beginning."
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "anti-sanguine-scientifically:1pyalqc",
          "html": "1. Take a vial from the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Vial_cabinet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">vial cabinet</a> in the north.",
          "text": "1. Take a vial from the vial cabinet in the north.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "anti-sanguine-scientifically:petkyx",
          "html": "2. Fill it with oil from the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Vat_of_oil\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">vat of oil</a> in the south.",
          "text": "2. Fill it with oil from the vat of oil in the south.",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "1",
                  "text": "Yes."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "anti-sanguine-scientifically:1je69qe",
          "html": "3. Sterilise the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Vial_of_oil\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">vial of oil</a> at the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Fireplace_(Wendlewick_lighthouse)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">fireplace</a> in the north-east.",
          "text": "3. Sterilise the vial of oil at the fireplace in the north-east.",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "1",
                  "text": "Yes."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "anti-sanguine-scientifically:aeilod",
          "html": "4. Take hedgehog spines from the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Bucket_of_hedgehog_spines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">bucket of hedgehog spines</a> in the east.",
          "text": "4. Take hedgehog spines from the bucket of hedgehog spines in the east.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "anti-sanguine-scientifically:ehjapi",
          "html": "5. Grind the spines, and mix the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Vial_of_oil_(s)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">vial of oil (s)</a> with the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Crushed_hedgehog_spines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">crushed hedgehog spines</a>.",
          "text": "5. Grind the spines, and mix the vial of oil (s) with the crushed hedgehog spines.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "anti-sanguine-scientifically:o0waiz",
          "html": "6. Take a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Wendlewick_poppy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Wendlewick poppy</a> from the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Sack_of_flowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">sack of flowers</a> in the south-east.",
          "text": "6. Take a Wendlewick poppy from the sack of flowers in the south-east.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "anti-sanguine-scientifically:1ujlwen",
          "html": "7. Press ingredient on the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Table_(Wendlewick_lighthouse)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">table</a> in the centre.",
          "text": "7. Press ingredient on the table in the centre.",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "1",
                  "text": "Press Wendlewick poppy."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "anti-sanguine-scientifically:vrvssg",
          "html": "8. Mix the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Vial_of_oil_(crushed_hedgehog_spine)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">vial of oil (crushed hedgehog spine)</a> with the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Pressed_Wendlewick_poppy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">pressed Wendlewick poppy</a>.",
          "text": "8. Mix the vial of oil (crushed hedgehog spine) with the pressed Wendlewick poppy.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "anti-sanguine-scientifically:gh7wqv",
          "html": "9. Take <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Wolf%27s_tongue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">wolf&#39;s tongue</a> from the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Sack_of_mushrooms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">sack of mushrooms</a> in the south.",
          "text": "9. Take wolf's tongue from the sack of mushrooms in the south.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "anti-sanguine-scientifically:wjfllx",
          "html": "10. Weigh ingredient on the desk in the north-west, weigh out 30g.",
          "text": "10. Weigh ingredient on the desk in the north-west, weigh out 30g.",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
